# Real Gaming Data Integration — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete **ELT pipeline + FastAPI backend** that ingests real CapFrameX JSON and PTAT Monitor CSV files and streams live performance data into the dashboard with synthetic fallback for any missing games.

---

## Architecture

```
WW0826_Baseline_Pcode_Ucode_patch_JEDEC/
├── PTAT_logs/         → 12 PTAT CSVs     (power, temp, freq, C-states, clip reason)
└── Presentmon_logs/   → 12 CapFrameX JSONs (frame times, FPS)
        │
        ▼
python -m backend.etl.process_build
        │  parses both file types, matches by game slug, writes to DuckDB
        ▼
backend/data/gaming_dashboard.duckdb
        │
        ▼
python -m uvicorn backend.main:app --port 8000
        │  6 REST endpoints: /api/summary, /api/timeseries, /api/programs, /api/builds, ...
        ▼
⚛️ React (Vite proxy → port 8000)
   useGameData hook  → KPI metrics (avgFps, power, temp)
   useTimeseries hook → 7 chart arrays on demand
```

---

