## New Files Created

### Backend (`backend/`)
| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| [requirements.txt](file:///c:/code/gaming-dashboard/backend/requirements.txt) | fastapi, uvicorn, duckdb, polars, pydantic, numpy |
| [db.py](file:///c:/code/gaming-dashboard/backend/db.py) | DuckDB schema — `game_summary` + [timeseries](file:///c:/code/gaming-dashboard/backend/main.py#184-226) tables |
| [parsers/capframex.py](file:///c:/code/gaming-dashboard/backend/parsers/capframex.py) | Parses CapFrameX JSON → avgFps, 1%Low, 0.1%Low, 500-pt frame time chart |
| [parsers/ptat.py](file:///c:/code/gaming-dashboard/backend/parsers/ptat.py) | Parses PTAT CSV via Polars → power/temp/freq/clip/C-state timeseries |
| [parsers/game_map.py](file:///c:/code/gaming-dashboard/backend/parsers/game_map.py) | CapFrameX GameName/exe → dashboard game slug mapping |
| [parsers/sku_map.py](file:///c:/code/gaming-dashboard/backend/parsers/sku_map.py) | PTAT CPU Name → dashboard SKU ID mapping |
| [etl/process_build.py](file:///c:/code/gaming-dashboard/backend/etl/process_build.py) | CLI: scan folder, parse, merge, write to DuckDB |
| [main.py](file:///c:/code/gaming-dashboard/backend/main.py) | FastAPI with 6 endpoints |

