- **programs.js**: NVL S updated to **28C/56T**, TDP corrected to **125W**, added `iGFX` SKU variant

---

## How to Run a New Build

```powershell
# From c:\code\gaming-dashboard
python -m backend.etl.process_build `
    --build WW0902 `
    --input "C:\path\to\WW0902_build_folder" `
    --sku nvl-s

# Start the API server (if not already running)
python -m uvicorn backend.main:app --port 8000 --reload
```

The dashboard will automatically pick up the new build — it appears in the build selector sidebar.

---

## Fallback Strategy

- If the FastAPI server is unreachable, all game cards **silently fall back to synthetic data generators**
- Games with real data show actual measured numbers; unmeasured games show seeded synthetic numbers
- This means Arrow Lake and Panther Lake SKUs still work fully in demo mode
